  "notes": "Tip already holds wooden emblem (105:emblem taken). Do not acquire it. Keep emblem@10F_alcove USE after gold_emblem. After shield_key, walk 105 east-wing to 118 chemical. Then use_box to Muse leave_118 (bank shield_key), shotgun 109->115->116, return 116->115->109 (not 116->106). Tea-room lock: 104->103 stays locked until 103->104 is traversed once (this chunk never opens it). After star crest: 117->10A->11A place_star_crest, then 2F cut 11A->10A->10B->207->204->203->202->201->101->103->10C, pump, armor_key, then exactly two red + two green bench herbs in order red/green/red/green (floor has 4G+2R \u2014 a 3rd green or red is divert). Merge to GR before 102 so clip+shells fit; 102->101->100 use_box (leave_100: no heals on exit \u2014 incoming herbs/mixes/sprays deposit; bank acid_rounds, no bazooka) then 100->101->201->202->203->204->205. In 205 take 205:sun_crest:1. After sun_crest: Richard bleedout FIRST (capture:false \u2014 cinema dumps to C passage 204, no pl84/pl85 cells), then place_sun_crest at 11A, then dining 2F enter + push_statue_2f. After statue: 202->203->106->105 take blue jewel, backtrack 105->106->203->202->201->101->103 (skip vacant 102 \u2014 already looted), 103->10D tiger eye + wind_crest. After wind_crest in 10D: loot 10E clip+shells, unlock tea via 103->104, first-floor 104->105->106, dressing 111 shelf clip + locked-desk shells (one of each), then 111->112 take both SE green herbs (112:green_herb:1 then :2), return 112->111->106, art circuit 106->107->108->109->10A->11A, place_wind_crest. Tip cell pl110. After place_wind_crest (pl134): 11A->10A->10B->118 go_to_box/use_box (deposit green_herb; withdraw shield_key+acid_rounds), deer wing 207->208->209 (red/clip/lighter) ->20A explosive, terrace 203->211->212 bazooka_acid, then 204->20D greens (:1/:2) ->20E->210 attic_enter. Tip cell pl134. After 209 lighter + 209->208 (pl147): MUST box at 118 before 20A (inv full). Muse v3: 208->207->10B->118 use_box banks armor_key+lighter (deer already unlocked; no 20F lighter use this staging), keep beretta/shotgun/shield_key/acid_rounds/red_herb/handgun_bullets, return deer, 208->20A acquire explosive_rounds. Skip 20D greens and attic this staging chunk (herb brick with Yawn kit). Tip cell pl147. Raw: _tmp/pl147_muse_v3_response.json. After 208->20A: study_insect_switch \u2192 study_push_fishtank \u2192 study_push_cupboard \u2192 20A:explosive_rounds:1, then Muse pl157 path box\u2192212 GL\u219220D greens\u2192yawn mint\u2192place_moon_crest. After place_moon_crest (pl196): Phase-1.5 shed+square_crank, courtyard 300\u2192302\u2192304\u2192400, residence keys, V-Jolt@409, apply@40E, Plant 42, helmet_key end_anchor. cover_plant_hole omitted (no room-400 RAM latch).",
